 "seed": 21,
 "sentences": [
  {
   "text": "The stone that signed this tablet seems lost. Its signature isn't.",
   "exaggeration": 0.5,
   "cfg_weight": 0.5,
   "pause": 0.35,
   "kind": "F"
  },
  {
   "text": "Five thousand years ago, someone had to track barley.",
   "exaggeration": 0.7,
   "cfg_weight": 0.45,
   "pause": 0.4,
   "kind": "P"
  },
  {
   "text": "So signs were drawn in wet clay, probably for a handout.",
   "exaggeration": 0.5,
   "cfg_weight": 0.5,
   "pause": 0.35,
   "kind": "F"
  },
  {
   "text": "But signs alone can't count.",
   "exaggeration": 0.7,
   "cfg_weight": 0.45,
   "pause": 0.4,
   "kind": "P"
  },
  {
   "text": "So they pressed round marks: numbers.",
   "exaggeration": 0.8,
   "cfg_weight": 0.4,
   "pause": 0.45,
   "kind": "H"
  },
  {
   "text": "But who vouched for it?",
   "exaggeration": 0.7,
   "cfg_weight": 0.45,
   "pause": 0.4,
   "kind": "P"
  },
  {
   "text": "A carved stone seal, rolled across like a signature.",
   "exaggeration": 0.8,
   "cfg_weight": 0.4,
   "pause": 0.45,
   "kind": "H"
  },
  {
   "text": "A man leading leashed dogs after wild boars in a marsh.",
   "exaggeration": 0.5,
   "cfg_weight": 0.5,
   "pause": 0.35,
   "kind": "F"
  },
  {
   "text": "Among the earliest writing known, and mostly record-keeping.",
   "exaggeration": 0.55,
   "cfg_weight": 0.5,
   "pause": 0.5,
   "kind": "L1"
  },
  {
   "text": "The stone's gone. The picture stays.",
   "exaggeration": 0.65,
   "cfg_weight": 0.4,
